      "writtenOn": "2024-10-08T14:31:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the name `MatchWidth` is fine, you\u0027re either matching 1 which is scalar or a vector. We could do `MatchLength` but I think the consistency of `MatchWidth` is better.\n\nThose other builder functions all use the vectors to pass the values through.",
      "parentUuid": "5f3355d9_04a3ebed",
      "revId": "b539032672d2d0c4bd6d125cb851867c2c6a931f",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
